le-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find my mind dissecting Symphogear and Honkai Impact 3rd regarding this.<br /> <br /> Interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cTo the Abandoned Sacred Beasts\u201d (season just concluded on Crunchyroll): in a variant on a post-Civil War setting, a Devoted Epimorph hunts down and kills former comrades who are now Renegade Epimorphs to prevent them from going Feral. He is driven by Loyalty to the memory of his Progenitor and to a baseline Hunter companion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T13:13:57-07:00","id":1336929,"title":"","content":"Four hours in, and we're past the halfway point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T13:24:06-07:00","id":1336934,"title":"","content":"I haven't started reading the preview yet but I'm making a post in this thread so I can more easily find it later. <br /> <br /> Also super damn excited. Currently only have the money to back the 5$ level (i'm not even mad though because the budget went to relatively good seats to seeing Ghost live) but will likely up it to the usual physical copy later.<br /> <br /> SUPER Excite!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T14:53:57-07:00","id":1336947,"title":"","content":"so quick question. does anyone know if the PoD version is going to be hardcover? Because as much as I want the deluxe hardcover I do not have that kind of money(I want to splurge on Hunter.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T15:00:58-07:00","id":1336949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336891#post1336891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few questions for people who have pledged on previous CofD Kickstarters: what are these hardcovers like? Are they worth the cost quality-wise? Have you used them at the table, or do you see them more as collector's items?</div> </div> </div> </div>DtD and CtL were definitely worth. tbh getting the prestige edition through kickstarter is cheaper than getting premium from DtRPG since you get the PDFs with them. <br /> <br /> But to answer your question, in my opinion they are definitely worth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T17:00:52-07:00","id":1336962,"title":"","content":"At last, <i>At long, long last</i>. <br /> <br /> Allow me to present my credentials: I named and wrote the first version of the <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PhlebotinumRebel\" target=\"_blank\">Phlebotinum Rebel</a> page on TV Tropes. As you can imagine, I am about as hyped as it is possible to be for Deviant without spontaneously Diverging into a new. terrifying form.<br /> <br /> Standard batch of inspirational quotes:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;It is the nature of men to make monsters, and it is the nature of monsters to destroy their makers.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u2014 Dr. Harlan Wade, </span></span></span><i>F.E.A.R.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Kamen Rider, Takeshi Hongo, is a modified human. He was altered by Shocker, an evil secret society with aspirations for world domination. Kamen Rider fights against Shocker for the sake of human freedom!</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;A devil's body with a human heart. I am Devilman!&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;Do you know what 'Guyver' means in the language of the Creators? 'Beyond control.'&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;His embrace is death... the slightest contact, decay. Fear his touch, for he is... Baoh!&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> ...let's rock.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T17:36:54-07:00","id":1336970,"title":"","content":"So reading the preview and I like what I see so far. One problem.... they didn't put the Six Million Dollar Man under tv shows for inspirational material <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T17:44:07-07:00","id":1336971,"title":"","content":"If I recall correctly, they also didn't put Buffy the Vampire Slayer in there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T17:55:51-07:00","id":1336974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336971#post1336971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I recall correctly, they also didn't put Buffy the Vampire Slayer in there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Never really watched Buffy. but I would put her more into the Hunter line. while Six-Million Dollar Man had a Unwilling. granted he was more devoted but come on the classic &quot;We can rebuild him, we have the technology.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T18:05:27-07:00","id":1336977,"title":"","content":"Weirdly, the bit on the Web of Pain, actually made me excited for the playable Devoted (Deviants loyal to the conspiracies) guide they've teased.<br /> <br /> It's made very clear what makes the conspiracies evil is their refusal to consider Remade human or at least valued agents. Presumably a player conspiracy is more ethical than that, hence why Devoted are presumably able to influence its political agenda. The Web of Pain, though, is an entire subculture of shadows dedicated to exploitation and dehumanization. How do you retain your ethics in such a ruthless and toxic environment and yet survive?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T18:07:29-07:00","id":1336979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336974#post1336974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Never really watched Buffy. but I would put her more into the Hunter line. while Six-Million Dollar Man had a Unwilling. granted he was more devoted but come on the classic &quot;We can rebuild him, we have the technology.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. Buffy is a Genotypal Deviant, Born with abilities that had been engineered into her lineage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 09-19-2019, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T18:14:00-07:00","id":1336980,"title":"","content":"Seriously, people constantly wanted to take her apart or control her too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:07:51-07:00","id":1336985,"title":"","content":"well I did my 5 dollars in lol. wish I could put more in and looking forward to this game finishing up tomorrow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:11:37-07:00","id":1336986,"title":"","content":"I hope the Chiron Group gets mentioned as a Conspiracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:20:36-07:00","id":1336989,"title":"","content":"I'm sure they will be. That said, I'm expecting a \u201cbuild your own conspiracy\u201d setup, with one or two examples of what a Conspiracy might look like; and if the Chiron Group isn't mentioned, it will be easy enough to use it anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:37:19-07:00","id":1336991,"title":"","content":"Because I can, Beast/Deviant Stereotypes:<br /> <br /> <b>Anakim:</b> Meteorites break up, too.<br /> <b>Eshamki:</b> You could disappear like a shadow? Not if we kill the lights.<br /> <b>Makara:</b> I thought I was drowning too. Turns out I was just learning to swim.<br /> <b>Namtaru:</b> It's not fear, love, it's jealousy. Unless you want it to be fear, of course.<br /> <b>Ugallu:</b> I do adore someone who wears hearts on their sleeves. Yours, theirs, not much difference.<br /> <b>Inguma: </b>Let me show you what went wrong.<br /> <b>Talassi:</b> Your body is a cage? What do you put in it, then?<br /> <br /> <b>Autourgics:</b> You got it together. I <i>almost</i> did.<br /> <b>Epimorphs:</b> You make it sound like a sweet deal, but is that what you actually got?<br /> <b>Exomorphs:</b> I wouldn't have said yes if I had a chance. I'm not sure why I should say yes <i>now</i>.<br /> <b>Genotypal:</b> See, you chose to be Bluebeard. I was Bluebeard the minute he decided to have a kid.<br /> <b>Pathological:</b> Easy to extoll your yellow brick road when no one threw a tornado at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-19-2019, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T19:56:48-07:00","id":1336994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336907#post1336907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reading the preview:<br /> <br /> Not a criticism, but, uh, how many fans of shonen and seinen are there at Onyx Path? Because this is the most gleefully hot-blooded thing they've ever done. There's even lore justified season progression (the Web of Pain, the realization the evil organization you just crushed has superiors and/or lieutenants that want to reform it, or worse rivals).</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been known to indulge in some &quot;anime and wine&quot; nights with my housemate (currently working through My Hero Academia), so the DNA is in there. But in truth, there are so many books and movies and shows that work as &quot;Deviant stories&quot; that it's surprisingly easy to find them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336970#post1336970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So reading the preview and I like what I see so far. One problem.... they didn't put the Six Million Dollar Man under tv shows for inspirational material <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>As I allude to above, OMG, you guys, I was already over word count by like 8,000 words! Yeah, the inspirational media list is ridiculously short just because we had to cram so many other things into the core that I fantasized about TTRPG books that use Time Lord technology so they're like a TARDIS, except with words. Dave gave me a list of something like 100 different media characters that inspired him, and I barely recognized a quarter of them, but the more I worked on this game, the more it seemed like I saw Deviant stories everywhere I looked, and I could probably give you a separate list of 100 media examples of Deviant characters or Deviant stories.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336977#post1336977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weirdly, the bit on the Web of Pain, actually made me excited for the playable Devoted (Deviants loyal to the conspiracies) guide they've teased.<br /> <br /> It's made very clear what makes the conspiracies evil is their refusal to consider Remade human or at least valued agents. Presumably a player conspiracy is more ethical than that, hence why Devoted are presumably able to influence its political agenda. The Web of Pain, though, is an entire subculture of shadows dedicated to exploitation and dehumanization. How do you retain your ethics in such a ruthless and toxic environment and yet survive?</div> </div> </div> </div>*whistles innocently*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336979#post1336979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope. Buffy is a Genotypal Deviant, Born with abilities that had been engineered into her lineage.</div> </div> </div> </div>A Genotypal Coactive, specifically, yes - starts out Devoted and becomes a Renegade in later seasons. She was one of the ones on Dave's list that I knew well enough to go, &quot;ah yes, of course!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336989#post1336989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sure they will be. That said, I'm expecting a \u201cbuild your own conspiracy\u201d setup, with one or two examples of what a Conspiracy might look like; and if the Chiron Group isn't mentioned, it will be easy enough to use it anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the cardinal rules of CofD is that we don't do crossover in core books (Beast being a notable exception, for obvious reasons), so Cheiron doesn't get a mention, although it is a pretty easy one to tie in. If I get to do a Storytellers Guide (the traditional place for crossover mechanics), the Conspiracies of Hunter are almost universally shining examples of potential Web of Pain conspiracies (as I've gone on about at some length in the large Deviant thread on these forums). And &quot;build your conspiracy&quot; is a part of character creation. The core doesn't have one or two example conspiracies. It has *11* (plus a twelfth that makes a guest appearance). They're in Chapter Six, though, so it will be awhile before the previews reveal them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":1094,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","user":"Eric Zawadzki","date":".  In my excitement, I forgot how to properly use there/their/they're. :-P 09-19-2019, 11:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T20:25:44-07:00","id":1337002,"title":"","content":"Lemme do you one better.<br /> <br /> <b>Blood Talons: </b>You are the epitome of Ivory Claw philosophy. Yes, they are assholes, how could you tell?<br /> <b>Bone Shadows: </b>Some rites should not be attempted....<br /> <b>Hunters in Darkness: </b>So <i>that's </i>what's causing those Wounded loci. Want some hunting tips, terror to terror?<br /> <b>Iron Masters: </b>So, should we follow your lead, or mine?<br /> <b>Storm Lords: </b>The difference between us is the source of our enemies. Sometimes not even that.<br /> <br /> <b>Autourgics: </b>You didn't chose your duty. So why are you happier?<br /> <b>Epimorphs: </b>At least we know the people who chose us hated us.<br /> <b>Exomorphs: </b>Careful, Fido. I know your patrons' type. They aren't friends.<br /> <b>Genotypal: </b>...I'm sorry. I can't think when I'm envious.<br /> <b>Pathological: </b>Genetic time bomb, nuclear reactor accident, tomayto, tomahto.<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> <b>Spring: </b>First: Calm down and live a bit. I think I know their type, which means we can bait them.<br /> <b>Summer: </b>Well. I didn't expect to punish Keeper cosplayers today...<br /> <b>Autumn: </b>Proposal; you teach me a little about you, I make your makers regret the day their parents met. Teaching optional.<br /> <b>Winter: </b>You know the reason we remain quiet.<br /> <br /> <b>Autourgics: </b>Us from the mirror universe. I'm from the bad one.<br /> <b>Epimorphs: </b>Watch it. I'm not a fan of sudden deals.<br /> <b>Exomorphs: </b>Look on the bright side. You can <i>relax.</i><br /> <b>Genotypal: </b>You had a life before the empowerment - and the abuse.<br /> <b>Pathological: </b>Fuck, any door? Welp, if someone Diverges with thorns, we know who to blame.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T20:39:16-07:00","id":1337004,"title":"","content":"I feel like if you're gonna do Changeling, it's gotta be Seeming to Clade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T21:09:02-07:00","id":1337008,"title":"","content":"<b>Beast: </b>I chose to be less than human. You were forced to be more.<br /> <b>Darkling: </b>You are the answer to riddles nobody should have solved.<br /> <b>Elemental: </b>We tell the same story about hubris.<br /> <b>Fairest: </b>But for the glory of Faerie go I. That's the only difference.<br /> <b>Ogre: </b>I'm lucky. I came back having to put friends before revenge.<br /> <b>Wizened: </b>Your masters and mine share a toolbox. And who is in it.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <b>Cephalic: </b>You rely on law, we are our own. It's...exhausting.<br /> <b>Chimerics: </b>I don't know what nature got in you, but it rhymes with what's in me.<br /> <b>Coactive: </b>You are the adapter, I am the generator.<br /> <b>Invasive: </b>Careful with your toys. Trust me, the drawback's a symptom of planning to move in.<br /> <b>Mutant: </b>Difference is, you stopped at one form. Mostly because it suits you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T22:05:16-07:00","id":1337017,"title":"","content":"So is there going to be a \u201cFate itself conspires to ruin your life\u201d Scar because that\u2019s the one Buffy has at 5. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T22:12:22-07:00","id":1337023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337017#post1337017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So is there going to be a \u201cFate itself conspires to ruin your life\u201d Scar because that\u2019s the one Buffy has at 5. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, that has to be an inevitability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T22:15:09-07:00","id":1337024,"title":"","content":"So Adaptations are pretty neat as basic everyone-gets-this kit, and I think at least one of my players is going to definitely appreciate the mechanical role &quot;everyone gets a desperation move&quot; plays for the Remade.<br /> <br /> This can probably be inferred, but does the Scar Magnitude reduction of Untamed last for the rest of the scene?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T23:36:18-07:00","id":1337031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336994#post1336994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the cardinal rules of CofD is that we don't do crossover in core books (Beast being a notable exception, for obvious reasons), so Cheiron doesn't get a mention, although it is a pretty easy one to tie in. If I get to do a Storytellers Guide (the traditional place for crossover mechanics), the Conspiracies of Hunter are almost universally shining examples of potential Web of Pain conspiracies (as I've gone on about at some length in the large Deviant thread on these forums). And &quot;build your conspiracy&quot; is a part of character creation. The core doesn't have one or two example conspiracies. It has *11* (plus a twelfth that makes a guest appearance). They're in Chapter Six, though, so it will be awhile before the previews reveal them.</div> </div> </div> </div>You might not be able to answer this yet, but still... what, or maybe I should ask <i>why</i>, is the difference between a Cyborg/Hybrid Deviant and a Cheiron Hunter with a few implants?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:01:56-07:00","id":1337035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337031#post1337031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might not be able to answer this yet, but still... what, or maybe I should ask <i>why</i>, is the difference between a Cyborg/Hybrid Deviant and a Cheiron Hunter with a few implants?</div> </div> </div> </div>Cheiron Hunters don't have a cracked soul, Cherion Deviants do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:14:32-07:00","id":1337038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337035#post1337035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cheiron Hunters don't have a cracked soul, Cherion Deviants do.</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't answer my question.<br /> <br /> To put it another way, is there a difference between the procedures? Is splicing monster bits into humans <i>without</i> turning them Deviant something unique to Cheiron? Can Cheiron choose between the two?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:15:30-07:00","id":1337039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336986#post1336986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope the Chiron Group gets mentioned as a Conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe Erik has been clear that it won\u2019t be in the Deviant Core, but likely in a future supplement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:22:51-07:00","id":1337040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337038#post1337038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That doesn't answer my question.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it does, just not in a way helpful to you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337038#post1337038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To put it another way, is there a difference between the procedures?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337038#post1337038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Is splicing monster bits into humans <i>without</i> turning them Deviant something unique to Cheiron?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. Many groups can fail to trigger the divergence with their random procedures.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337038#post1337038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can Cheiron choose between the two?</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly. It depends on what their procedures are. <br /> <br /> Or put it another way. If Cheiron\u2019s whole \u2018procedure\u2019 is just shoving bits of monster into humans, surgically connecting a blood supply, waiting to see what happens and applauding themselves when anything positive works at all, then the occasional divergence that triggers and really integrates the full potential of the monster bits is a random surprise and almost outside their control.<br /> <br /> If, on the other hand, Cheiron spends most of their time just slapping in organs in a repeatable way, but has a parallel line where they do that but run a bunch of experimental procedures where they also add drug cocktails, or jolts of electricity, or do it in a magic circle, and this triggers the divergence more frequently, then yes they do have some control.<br /> <br /> But like all divergence processes, \u201ccontrol\u201d is a tenuous concept at best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:47:31-07:00","id":1337043,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Divergence isn't an exact science, or even occultic process. Not surprising for something that is sometimes not even a desirable outcome and other times exactly the thing you want to have happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T05:11:51-07:00","id":1337060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1336994#post1336994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dave gave me a list of something like 100 different media characters that inspired him, and I barely recognized a quarter of them, but the more I worked on this game, the more it seemed like I saw Deviant stories everywhere I looked, and I could probably give you a separate list of 100 media examples of Deviant characters or Deviant stories</div> </div> </div> </div>Any chance you might post some of those here or a blog or something or will OPP not want to allow that. I am deeply curious, especially about the obscure ones. I can with some effort think of like 15 or 20 really good examples based on what we know so far, but 100 is nuts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T05:14:56-07:00","id":1337063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337017#post1337017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So is there going to be a \u201cFate itself conspires to ruin your life\u201d Scar because that\u2019s the one Buffy has at 5. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Misfortune, so yes. And her player is definitely milking it for the Beats.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337024#post1337024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This can probably be inferred, but does the Scar Magnitude reduction of Untamed last for the rest of the scene?</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337040#post1337040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possibly. It depends on what their procedures are.<br /> <br /> Or put it another way. If Cheiron\u2019s whole \u2018procedure\u2019 is just shoving bits of monster into humans, surgically connecting a blood supply, waiting to see what happens and applauding themselves when anything positive works at all, then the occasional divergence that triggers and really integrates the full potential of the monster bits is a random surprise and almost outside their control.<br /> <br /> If, on the other hand, Cheiron spends most of their time just slapping in organs in a repeatable way, but has a parallel line where they do that but run a bunch of experimental procedures where they also add drug cocktails, or jolts of electricity, or do it in a magic circle, and this triggers the divergence more frequently, then yes they do have some control.<br /> <br /> But like all divergence processes, \u201ccontrol\u201d is a tenuous concept at best.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a pretty good summation of my current thinking on the subject. A lot will depend on what your chronicle needs and which game you're playing. In a Hunter game, Cheiron, VASCU, et. al. have processes that grant members supernatural abilities in a very limited way, and cracked souls are not an outcome within the scope of the game. In a chronicle of a Deviant game that uses Hunter Conspiracies as significant players, Divergence occurs in the process rarely, frequently, or even most of the time (as your chronicle requires). Deviant's core isn't going to address these questions head-on, however.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T07:45:53-07:00","id":1337091,"title":"","content":"This is all very exciting. I can't wait to see the full manuscript; just what's been revealed so far is washing me over in ideas for characters and stories. It's also cool finally to see Adaptations. They're not what I expected, but still very neat.<br /> <br /> Also neat is the fact that Deviant's concept of the soul meshes really nicely with Demon's. I feel like you could do a lot with that.<br /> <br /> Speaking of which, since others are doing it. . .<br /> <br /> <b>Analysts:</b> While you were ranting, I crunched the numbers. The odds are staggeringly low, but a one-in-a-trillion chance is still a chance.<br /> <b>Destroyers:</b> I was a tool once, too. Now I choose who to slay with my sword. Perhaps you agree.<br /> <b>Guardians:</b> If you're that scared of them going after your loved ones, we might be able to work something out.<br /> <b>Messengers:</b> Look at the way they talk about you, as if they can't decide whether you're a triumph or a mistake. All the spin in the world won't alleviate a guilty conscience.<br /> <b>Psychopomps:</b> Once again, humanity finds a way to surprise me. A shame it's not always pleasant.<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> <b>Autourgics:</b> I know it's perverse, but I can't help but feel a little jealous.<br /> <b>Epimorphs:</b> You talk a lot like my old boss.<br /> <b>Exomorphs: </b>Don't talk to me or my symbiont ever again.<br /> <b>Genotypals:</b> . . .What do you mean, &quot;It can be retroactive?&quot;<br /> <b>Pathologicals:</b> And what if the coincidence <i>is</i> the enemy action?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1423,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","user":"espritdecalmar","date":". 09-20-2019, 12:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T07:56:22-07:00","id":1337094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337091#post1337091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also neat is the fact that Deviant's concept of the soul meshes really nicely with Demon's. I feel like you could do a lot with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s also the first thing in CofD to clearly and deeply explore \u201csoul = sense of self\u201d in a way that probably won\u2019t actually cut down on the \u201cWillpower organ\u201d meme but it\u2019d be nice if it did.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T07:58:48-07:00","id":1337095,"title":"","content":"One of the bullet points under Affirming Wavering Touchstones in the preview today appears to have been cut off. It's the one that starts with &quot;<span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Having a Touchstone adds a level of solidity to the Renegade\u2019s actions concerning that person.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T08:30:56-07:00","id":1337097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337095#post1337095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the bullet points under Affirming Wavering Touchstones in the preview today appears to have been cut off. It's the one that starts with &quot;<span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Having a Touchstone adds a level of solidity to the Renegade\u2019s actions concerning that person.&quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>It should be: &quot;Having a Touchstone adds a level of solidity to the Renegade\u2019s actions concerning that person. All Deviants share the Stubborn Resolve Adaptation (p. XX), which helps them resist supernatural mental influence when acting in support of a Touchstone.&quot;<br /> <br /> Thanks for pointing that out. It's updated in the working draft (and even the backer-only preview that'll go up next week), but I didn't catch it until after the public KS previews were turned in. 95% finalized text, still needs to go through editing, and et cetera...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T09:52:27-07:00","id":1337107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alpharius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337060#post1337060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Any chance you might post some of those here or a blog or something or will OPP not want to allow that. I am deeply curious, especially about the obscure ones. I can with some effort think of like 15 or 20 really good examples based on what we know so far, but 100 is nuts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here\u2019s a partial list. These are the ones I tested the splats, Variations, and Scars against in redlines - I would have considered he game a failure if it couldn\u2019t recreate them all.<br /> <br /> \u2022 Alex Mack<br /> \u2022 Alex Mercer (Prototype)<br /> \u2022 Alister Peck (Fringe)<br /> \u2022 Alligator People (film)<br /> \u2022 Brindle (The Fly - 80s version)<br /> \u2022 Buffy Summers<br /> \u2022 Castor Clones (Orphan Black)<br /> \u2022 Cole (InFamous)<br /> \u2022 Darien Fawkes (The Invisible Man - 90 tv)<br /> \u2022 Dr Jackman (Moffat Jekyll)<br /> \u2022 Dr Jekyll (ITV)<br /> \u2022 Dr Jekyll (Original)<br /> \u2022 Dr Moreau's Creations<br /> \u2022 Dren (Splice)<br /> \u2022 Echo (Dollhouse)<br /> \u2022 Eleven (Stranger Things)<br /> \u2022 Enchantress (DC)<br /> \u2022 Gor (First Born)<br /> \u2022 Griffin (the Invisible Man)<br /> \u2022 Guyver<br /> \u2022 Hollow Man<br /> \u2022 Innsmouth Fishpeople<br /> \u2022 Jessica Jones<br /> \u2022 John Doe<br /> \u2022 June (The Innocents)<br /> \u2022 Kamen Rider<br /> \u2022 Kyle XY<br /> \u2022 Leda Clones (Orphan Black)<br /> \u2022 Luke Cage<br /> \u2022 Matt Murdock<br /> \u2022 Max (Dark Angel)<br /> \u2022 Max (Roswell)<br /> \u2022 Max (Videodrome)<br /> \u2022 Mr Tooms (X-Files)<br /> \u2022 Nick (Push)<br /> \u2022 Olivia Dunham (Fringe)<br /> \u2022 River Tam (Firefly)<br /> \u2022 Robocop (Original)<br /> \u2022 Robocop (Remake)<br /> \u2022 Scanners<br /> \u2022 Tandy and Tyrone (Cloak and Dagger)<br /> \u2022 Tetsuo (Akira)<br /> \u2022 Tetsuo (the Iron Man)<br /> \u2022 The Chrysalids<br /> \u2022 The Fly - original<br /> \u2022 The Hulk<br /> \u2022 The Tomorrow People (90s tv)<br /> \u2022 The Toxic Avenger<br /> \u2022 V (V for Vendetta)<br /> \u2022 Vincent (90s Beauty and the Beast)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Joi